 "reading_order": 33, "html": "<p>ध./१/१,१,१/१७/५ तत्थ जाई तब्भयसारिच्छ-लवखण-सामण्णं।</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [808.292, 1185.3600000000001, 1413.32, 1228.015]}, {"polygon": [[808.292, 1221.2800000000002], [1499.072, 1221.2800000000002], [1499.072, 1367.205], [808.292, 1367.205]], "confidence": 0.981479027671954, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 34, "html": "<p>ध./१/१,१,१/१८/३ तत्थ जाइणिमित्तं णाम गो-मणुस्स-घड-पड-त्थंभ-वेत्तादि। = तद्भव और सादृश्य लक्षणवाले सामान्यको जाति कहते हैं। गौ, मनुष्य, घट, पट, स्तम्भ और वेत इत्यादि जाति निमित्तक नाम है।</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [808.292, 1221.2800000000002, 1499.072, 1367.205]}, {"polygon": [[835.288, 1376.185], [1197.352, 1376.185], [1197.352, 1421.085], [835.288, 1421.085]], "confidence": 0.981479027671954, "label": "SectionHeader", "raw_label": "Section-Header", "reading_order": 35, "html": "<h2>२. जीवोंकी जातियोंका निर्देश</h2>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [835.288, 1376.185, 1197.352, 1421.085]}, {"polygon": [[808.292, 1430.065], [1499.072, 1430.065], [1499.072, 1542.315], [808.292, 1542.315]], "confidence": 0.981479027671954, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 36, "html": "<p>फ./२/१,१/४१६/४ एईदियादी पंच जादीओ, अदीदजादि विश्वतिथ। = एकेन्द्रियादि पाँच जातियों होती हैं और अतीत जातिरूप स्थान भी है।</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [808.292, 1430.065, 1499.072, 1542.315]}, {"polygon": [[835.288, 1549.05], [1235.464, 1549.05], [1235.464, 1596.195], [835.288, 1596.195]], "confidence": 0.981479027671954, "label": "SectionHeader", "raw_label": "Section-Header", "reading_order": 37, "html": "<h2>३. चार उत्सम जातियोंका निर्देश</h2>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [835.288, 1549.05, 1235.464, 1596.195]}, {"polygon": [[808.292, 1602.9299999999998], [1499.072, 1602.9299999999998], [1499.072, 1787.02], [808.292, 1787.02]], "confidence": 0.981479027671954, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_orde